<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>6P41 Recoil for Fuze/ Finka</Major>
    <Description>A recoil reduction macro for 6P41. LMG recoils are hard to manage for long bursts, so this was designed to make an entire mag dump possible on even a small mousepad. Micro adjustments are needed, but you should be able to acheive 100% upper body shot hits at any range with a little practice

Loadout: Vert, acog, comp

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 4 44 5 45
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 0 55
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 0 50
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -10 45
Delay 25 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>